# Cairn pre-commit gate (§19 "no slop"). Fails the commit if any check fails.
#   1. Full project type-check (strict).
#   2. Full ESLint pass (--max-warnings 0).
#   3. Prettier format check on all source files.
# Note: direct calls instead of lint-staged because lint-staged's stash/restore
# does not compose correctly with large git mv renames (§3.3 monorepo move).
pnpm typecheck
pnpm lint
pnpm -w run format:check
